- Flex: Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use against heavy early crowd control when landing the first Spatial Migration matters less than surviving the return stun.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use against healing or shield-heavy frontlines that survive the first airborne combo.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one diver can punish the end of Violet Requiem before the second Spatial Migration cast gets you out.
